Test rg43: -M covers the newly checked words -- a labeled word and an initialized table
// Overwrites are allowed under -M: a word the author wrote follows
// -M, whether or not it carries a label, and so does an element of an
// initialized table. Without -M this source is two fatal errors; with it, it
// assembles, and its .ref pins the words that result. rg25 is the same
// question for an unlabeled word.
100/
tgt,    cli
100/
    cla
200/
    cma
200/
table 2, 7
stop
